# Security headers for every response. Cloudflare consumes this file as
# config rather than serving it — /_headers should return 404 once deployed,
# which is the tell that it was picked up.
#
# CSP is REPORT-ONLY for now, deliberately. Concierge is in daily guest use
# and a wrong policy breaks real screens mid-service; violations log to the
# console instead. Flip the header name to Content-Security-Policy in a
# SECOND deploy, once every screen and role has been clicked through.
#
# Built from what this app actually loads, verified against the source:
#   script-src  jsdelivr = supabase-js UMD + qrcode-generator. There are NO
#               inline <script> blocks in any of the four pages, so no
#               'unsafe-inline' and no hashes are needed here.
#   style-src   'unsafe-inline' IS needed: update-check.js injects a <style>
#               element, and inline style attributes are set in JS (the
#               rating bars' widths, the banner's body offset).
#   img-src     Supabase storage serves the Sinagtala map. NOTE: no `data:`
#               — the QR codes are inline SVG (createSvgTag), not data URLs,
#               and the guest photo upload was removed on 2026-08-24. The
#               work order predicted data: would be required here; it is not.
#   connect-src Supabase REST + auth. No `wss:` on purpose — Concierge runs
#               no realtime subscription, and if one is ever added this line
#               must be revisited along with the reason it was avoided.
#   default-src 'none' so anything overlooked shows up as a report rather
#               than passing silently.
/*
  Content-Security-Policy-Report-Only: default-src 'none'; script-src 'self' https://cdn.jsdelivr.net; style-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline'; img-src 'self' https://lkeuiquqogtevsgvaddf.supabase.co; font-src 'self'; connect-src 'self' https://lkeuiquqogtevsgvaddf.supabase.co; base-uri 'self'; form-action 'self'; frame-ancestors 'none'; object-src 'none'
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  Permissions-Policy: geolocation=(), microphone=(), camera=()
